r-sq ft-atm G) 0.068 lb-mol per hr-sq ft-atm H) 0.2 lb-mol per sq ft-atm I) 0.135 lb-mol per hr-sq ft-atm J) 0.092 lb-mol per hr-sq ft-atm. Answer with the correct option letter and its content.", "mode": "escalated", "relay": "The correct answer is D, with a value of 0.174 lb-mol per sq ft-atm.", "expert_answer": "D) 0.174 lb-mol per sq ft-atm", "expert_latency_s": 18.92, "stall_ms": 20, "relay_ms": 543}
