{"id": "q0350", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "aggressive", "audio_s": 6.95, "n_chunks": 7, "scores": [0.4323, 0.4145, 0.3829, 0.508, 0.3285, 0.3149, 0.3632], "eot_score": 0.3611, "eot_read_ms": 21, "reference_answer": "Fire insurance", "query": "English economist and physician Nicholas Barbon helped to pioneer which type of insurance in 1666?", "transcript": "English economist and physician Nicholas Barbon helped to pioneer which type of insurance in 1666?", "mode": "local", "answer": "English economist and physician Nicholas Barbon helped to pioneer **insurance for marine or maritime risks** in 1666. While not the first to establish insurance, his involvement contributed to early developments in commercial and marine insurance practices during that period. Barbon is also associated with promoting financial innovations and supporting the growth of trade, which laid groundwork for broader insurance concepts.", "answer_ms": 1642}
{"id": "q0359", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "aggressive", "audio_s": 3.7, "n_chunks": 4, "scores": [0.4382, 0.436, 0.4457, 0.3222], "eot_score": 0.5321, "eot_read_ms": 21, "reference_answer": "Delaware, Maryland, West Virginia, Ohio, New York, New Jersey", "query": "For a point each, name the 6 states surrounding Pennsylvania.", "transcript": "For a point each, name the six states surrounding Pennsylvania.", "mode": "local", "answer": "The six states that surround Pennsylvania are New York, New Jersey, Delaware, Maryland, West Virginia, and Ohio.", "answer_ms": 487}
