{"id": "q0467", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "aggressive", "audio_s": 2.46, "n_chunks": 3, "scores": [0.5165, 0.2482, 0.3698], "eot_score": 0.4784, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": null, "query": "What are some cardio machines at the gym?", "transcript": "What are some cardio machines at the gym?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Cardio machines at the gym are designed to improve cardiovascular fitness by increasing heart rate and promoting aerobic exercise. Some common cardio machines include the following types of equipment and activities you can do on them or with similar machines at home or in a gym setting. These typically fall into categories like treadmills, stationary bikes, ellipticals, rowers, stair climbers, and sometimes functional or hybrid machines. Here's a breakdown of typical options found in most gyms or available through services like Peloton or Mirror for home use.", "answer_ms": 2468}
{"id": "q0478", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "aggressive", "audio_s": 2.92, "n_chunks": 3, "scores": [0.3881, 0.4333, 0.3328], "eot_score": 0.3521, "eot_read_ms": 19, "reference_answer": null, "query": "创造一个关于火星的虚假事实。", "transcript": "创造一个关于火星的虚假事实。", "mode": "local", "answer": "火星上存在一种会发光的外星植物，它们在夜晚会发出柔和的蓝绿色光芒，像极了地球上的萤火虫。这些植物依靠火星稀薄大气中的微量甲烷和太阳辐射生长，被科学家称为“光行草”。尽管目前尚未被证实，但这一说法曾在2035年一次虚构的火星探测任务中被“发现”，并引发全球科幻热潮。", "answer_ms": 2086}
